      "text": "输入\n                            3 4\r\n1 3 2 1\n                        \n                        \n                            输出\n                            1\n                        \n\n                                                    \n                                输入\n                                3 10\r\n1 2 1 3 2 3 1 2 2 1\n                            \n                            \n                                输出\n                                1"
